WEBVTT

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:04.060
Not alone

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:12.840
Because everyone worked hard at building
a house at the top of The Great Tree...

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:14.880
...a water-drawing device, a living room...

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:16.550
...the boys' room...

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:18.220
...the girls' room...

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.150
...a kitchen and washroom...

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:22.060
...and on top of that, a laundry...

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:26.530
...and then, the shower room that
everyone wanted, were all made.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.130
And finally, a front door.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:39.010
And thus, Everyone's House was completed.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.130
Since then, two weeks have passed.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:17.210
Alright...

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:57.580
No matter how far we walk,
there's not even a single fruit.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:00.760
We've searched all along our food map.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.310
Maybe we've depleted it all.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.160
I'm so hungry.

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:08.380
And we just finished the house.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:10.420
What are we going to do from here on out?

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:13.590
Instead of just complaining, suggest an alternative.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.280
Kaoru...

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:19.910
Where did you go?

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:23.430
Going off alone again, you're so independent.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:28.040
And we went through so much
trouble searching for food.

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:29.920
It's food!

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.890
Alright! It's dinner!

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:39.540
I'm thankful, but you were supposed
to leave the food supply to us.

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:42.240
We're not going to applaud you for grandstanding.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.390
Luna, what do you intend to do?

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:47.840
Well, well...

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:49.530
Thank you, Kaoru.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:53.060
Everyone's hungry, so we'll gladly accept them.

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.480
Where did you find these?

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.800
Let's add it to the food map.

00:04:58.420 --> 00:04:59.920
So, where was it?

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.750
There's none left. It's pointless to go there.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:04.030
What's up with that?

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:05.960
There's really nothing?

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.200
You're not trying to get a monopoly, are you?

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:10.760
Stop it!

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:19.740
Anyways, we know that we have to search somewhere other than where we've already been.

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:25.010
That's right. Tomorrow, let's split up
and search in places we haven't tried yet.

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:28.190
Yeah, yeah! There might still be lots out there.

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:49.660
What are you doing?

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.180
I think these might be tubers.

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:56.620
Look.

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:58.210
It's true!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.320
Are there more down here?

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:04.680
There are!

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:06.780
Wow!

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:12.070
Yeah, but who dug these up before we did?

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:29.980
This is bad...

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:32.390
These are his feeding grounds.

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:34.640
Run for it!

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:44.170
You don't hafta get so mad!

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:49.190
Don't tell me you want 'em all!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.390
He's pretty covetous.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.320
Well, we'll just let 'im wait there a while.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.110
They're not coming in.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:09.520
Kaoru...

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.030
Don't worry.

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.890
When you catch them, you sure catch a lot.

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:33.860
It makes yesterday hard to believe.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:39.220
If we'd known you'd catch so many fish,
we wouldn't have had to go searching for food.

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:40.760
Hindsight is 20/20.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.580
Nothing comes from saying that.

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:45.710
Hey, let's eat already!

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:55.330
Looks tasty, looks tasty!

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:57.860
We'll wait until Kaoru comes back before we eat.

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:02.380
I wonder where he went.

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:05.190
We don't have to wait for him.

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:14.690
Where did you go?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.040
Again?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.960
Everybody worries about you...

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:22.340
...stop going around on your own.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.860
We hadn't caught any fish by the afternoon.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:27.430
That's how long I wait every day.

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:31.270
Do you plan to make excuses for leaving Sharla behind?

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:35.450
But anyways, lookee! There's a huge crop today!

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:41.580
I wonder if we can even eat this much.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:47.040
Did you get caught up in the moment because everyone was pleased with you yesterday, Kaoru?

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.980
Anyways, he came back safely...

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:52.510
...so let's eat up.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.130
I'm going to clean these.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:58.400
Don't! Let's eat together!

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:01.340
What's up with him?

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:32.940
Here.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.040
Are you thinking about what I said?

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:45.410
I don't want you to make everyone worry.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:46.930
That's all it is.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.960
You have nothing to worry about.

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:54.240
And besides, people who can actually worry
deep down in their hearts...

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:56.580
...don't really exist.

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:00.560
Why would you say something like that?

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:03.650
If that were true...

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:06.580
...if we didn't worry about each other...

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.690
...how do you think we were
able to cooperate up until now?

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:15.460
Kaoru, you've helped us out,
and we should all help you out as well.

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:18.560
That's just what everyone did of their own volition.

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:26.080
Anyways, from now on, don't go around by yourself.

00:10:57.860 --> 00:10:59.730
Swing it more forcefully!

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:06.290
It's not a matter of just trying hard.

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.980
Look, it's crooked!

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:12.540
Change the angle more.

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:13.720
Wrong!

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:15.350
Shut up!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:40.330
We're finished.

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:44.090
If we can cultivate the potatoes,
things will get a little easier.

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:50.530
I'm tired!

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:52.610
Luna!

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.930
Let's take a little break!

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:58.400
You're right. Everyone, let's rest a while.

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:11.040
What's that?

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.980
Papa!

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:51.310
Everyone! Get in the house!

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:52.960
Howard!

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:56.730
Papa!

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:11.190
Howard, now!

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:24.880
That was close!

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:28.120
As long as we're here,
we don't have to worry about him attacking us.

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:44.280
What's he doin'?

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:46.660
It's dangerous! Come back!

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:56.960
Stop it! Kaoru!

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:08.940
Kaoru!

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.110
Luna...

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:25.330
This way!

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:30.880
Hurry!

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:47.730
More grandstanding?

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:50.060
It's impossible by yourself.

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.660
You even put Luna in a dangerous situation.

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:55.700
Not just that, but the giant lizard is going to stick around.

00:14:57.690 --> 00:14:58.930
It's your fault!

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:02.580
But I'm glad you're safe.

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:04.640
If we don't dress that...

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:06.640
I'm fine.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:13.480
Kaoru!

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:31.870
The bleeding will stop soon.

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:33.050
I don't need it.

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:33.950
Be quiet.

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:39.110
That was reckless.
He's not an enemy you can defeat.

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:42.860
It's fine. It's my choice.

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:47.710
Idiot!

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:50.790
You have to treat your life as something precious!

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:54.970
If you think you've lived this long
on your own, you're gravely mistaken!

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:56.530
Luna...

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:03.030
Stop that! Stop-- oh...

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:08.750
He got it.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.480
It looks like he plans to stay after all.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:14.000
What do we do?

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:16.270
Can we stay up here forever?

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:19.570
It looks like we've no choice but to exterminate it.

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:23.000
How will we pull that off?

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:25.140
It won't do just to hurt him.

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:28.630
Staying like this is better than that.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.350
I don't think we have any alternative.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:31.630
Bell...

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:37.420
Even if that monster leaves today, he'll come back.

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:42.730
So you're saying that eventually
we'll have to exterminate it anyways?

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:08.060
Are you sure this will work?

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.240
Let's try it!

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:17.000
Ready.

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:45.820
Once more!

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:00.740
Now!

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:16.640
Cut the rope!

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:46.780
Hey!

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:52.290
We did it!

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:04.640
Get away!

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:11.680
Luna!

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:23.320
If you're going to eat someone, eat me!

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:30.580
You have to treat your life as something precious!

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:32.940
She's...

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:46.640
...thgir ruoy ot raeps ehT

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:53.470
Kaoru...

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:58.810
Luna... people like you...

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:02.410
Thank you...

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:06.280
Luna...

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:12.030
Luna!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.600
Luna! I'm so relieved!

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:19.590
Kaoru...

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:24.880
If you hadn't gone, Luna would...

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:26.410
...by now...

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:30.180
Who's the most reckless after all?

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:47.510
Again, Luna?

00:21:47.980 --> 00:21:50.730
So? What did you hear this time?

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:53.790
"The stone spear is to your right."

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:58.960
Luna said she heard it, so it must be true.

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:01.140
You're all hopeless romantics.

00:22:01.890 --> 00:22:05.680
The uncouth Howard's just sayin' that
'cuz he didn't hear it.

00:22:05.750 --> 00:22:07.080
What?

00:22:16.890 --> 00:22:18.220
I think it's ready.

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:22.440
We finally had that much meat and fish.

00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:24.780
In the end, it's just potatoes.

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:26.840
It looks tasty.

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:29.940
Complainers don't hafta eat.

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:32.490
I wasn't complaining!

00:22:34.510 --> 00:22:35.680
I'll have some too.

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:43.530
Give me a little more.

00:22:43.660 --> 00:22:45.520
You're not gettin' just potatoes!

00:22:45.520 --> 00:22:47.510
Anyways, let's hurry up and eat!

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:49.550
You're right! Well, then...

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:52.160
A toast to the chef!

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:05.430
Something is calling out to me.

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:06.480
"Something?"

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:08.470
I have to go to the eastern woods!

00:23:08.640 --> 00:23:10.590
Huh? What'cha doin' all of a sudden?

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:13.230
Goin' somewhere we ain't been yet?

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:15.540
Well, will you be okay?

00:23:15.760 --> 00:23:19.310
I don't know that, but I feel that
we'll find something out if we go!

00:23:19.530 --> 00:23:20.510
Really...

00:23:20.810 --> 00:23:23.080
Alright! Be careful 'n come back safe, Luna!

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:27.800
Next time: I heard a voice.
